   "body": "Status (cloud/i970-sonnet): #986 is merged (`Refs #970`). Done: a tap on « Version » in Réglages and À propos copies `SwiftHFR <version> (<build>) · <commit> · <OS> · <model>`, shows « Copié » and posts a VoiceOver announcement; the row shows the commit when known; formatter and tap tested (missing key, missing commit, simulator model, second tap).\n\n**Left, this issue stays open:** the build-time injection of `HFRGitCommit`. Without it every build shows no commit (`?`). It waits on the question above (`ENABLE_USER_SCRIPT_SANDBOXING = NO` on the target, or an untracked `Config/GitCommit.xcconfig` written by a pre-build step). I keep the claim and do nothing on it until you answer; say « sandbox off » or « xcconfig » and I open the PR.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
